#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:1
msgid "What's New in FlagOS 2.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS 2.2 extends the shared software stack for multi-chip model "
"training and inference. This release adds new framework integrations and "
"developer tools, expands operator and compiler capabilities, introduces "
"an Arm CPU compilation path, and publishes additional quantization and "
"model deployment resources."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:5
msgid ""
"The results in this page are release examples rather than universal "
"performance or compatibility guarantees. Support and benchmark results "
"depend on the model, backend, hardware, software version, and test "
"configuration described in each section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:7
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:9
msgid ""
"**Framework integrations:** Updates to vLLM-Plugin-FL and SGLang-Plugin-"
"FL, and the first FlagOS integration for PyTorch through Torch-FL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:10
msgid ""
"**Training stack:** Updates to Megatron-LM-FL, TransformerEngine-FL, and "
"FlagScale for model training and lifecycle management."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:11
msgid ""
"**Operator and compiler tooling:** Expanded operator coverage, new "
"SGLang-specific operators, compiler and auto-tuning improvements, and "
"additional routing options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:12
msgid ""
"**Arm CPU inference:** First release of FlagTree-CPU as an independent "
"compilation component for low-bit Arm64 workloads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:13
msgid ""
"**Model conversion:** First release of FlagOS-Compressor for weight "
"conversion and W4A16, W8A16, and dynamic W8A8 workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:14
msgid ""
"**Kernel development:** First release of FlagPrism for cross-backend "
"Triton debugging and profiling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:15
msgid ""
"**Model delivery:** Additional Day 0 model adaptations, deployment "
"configurations, and model images through FlagRelease."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:17
msgid "Runtime and framework integrations"
