#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:122
msgid "Quantization and model compression"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:124
msgid "FlagOS-Compressor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:126
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor is introduced as a cross-backend weight conversion and "
"quantization tool. It reads Hugging Face `safetensors` checkpoints and "
"provides a workflow for selecting modules, converting weights, exporting "
"deployment artifacts, and validating the resulting tensors and "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:128
msgid "The release describes the following quantization schemes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:130
msgid "**W4A16:** INT4 weights with 16-bit activations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:131
msgid "**W8A16:** INT8 weights with 16-bit activations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:132
msgid "**Dynamic W8A8:** INT8 weights with per-token dynamic INT8 activations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:134
msgid ""
"The quantization scope can be selected by module, including attention, "
"MLP, MoE experts, shared experts, vision encoders, embeddings, "
"normalization, and routing gates. Exported artifacts include quantized "
"weights, scale parameters, shard indexes, runtime configuration, and "
"integrity checks. The output format described in the release material is "
"`compressed-tensors`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:136
msgid "Large-model examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:138
msgid "The source material reports two deployment examples:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:140
msgid ""
"**Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B:** BF16 and FP8 source weights were processed through"
" INT8 paths for selected modules. The release material describes "
"deployment artifacts and configurations for selected BANG, Ascend, and "
"Hygon environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:141
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Qwen3.5-397B-A17B:** Attention and MoE expert networks were quantized "
"with W8A8 while the vision encoder remained in BF16. The reported model "
"size changed from 751.41 GB to 382.45 GB, a 49.1% reduction. The reported"
" GPQA-Diamond result was 84.85% (168/198) for the stated evaluation "
"configuration, with end-to-end validation on NVIDIA H20 and a PPU "
"backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:143
msgid ""
"The model names, backend availability, evaluation scripts, and exact "
"conversion options should be checked against the corresponding model "
"cards and deployment configurations before reproducing these examples."
msgstr ""

